---
title: Night City
description: Generative scenes that run forever and never repeat.
ogPath: ""
---
{% extends "layouts/site.njk" %}

{% block main %}
<main id="top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Generative scenes</p>
    <h1>Scenes that never repeat</h1>
    <p class="lead">Each scene is a small set of rules fed by one random generator. Nothing is scripted and nothing loops, so no two runs play the same way.</p>

    <section id="scenes" aria-labelledby="scenes-h">
      <h2 class="section" id="scenes-h">Scenes</h2>
      <ul class="scenes">
{%- for s in collections.scenes %}
        <li>
          <a class="scene" href="{{ s.url.slice(1) }}">
            <div class="preview">
              <iframe data-src="{{ s.url.slice(1) }}" title="Live preview of {{ s.data.title }}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"></iframe>
              <span class="added">Added on <time datetime="{{ s.data.added }}">{{ s.data.added | cardDate }}</time></span>
            </div>
            <div class="info">
              <div>
                <h3>{{ s.data.title }}</h3>
                <p>{{ s.data.card }}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </a>
        </li>
{%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="how" aria-labelledby="how-h">
      <h2 class="section" id="how-h">How it works</h2>
      <ul class="rules">
        <li><b>One seed</b><span>A single random generator, seeded from the clock when the page opens, drives every choice.</span></li>
        <li><b>Independent timers</b><span>Each kind of event waits a random gap, so the scene has bursts and lulls instead of a beat.</span></li>
        <li><b>Variation inside events</b><span>Speed, colour, size and duration come from continuous ranges. No two taxis are quite the same taxi.</span></li>
        <li><b>Slow drift</b><span>Smooth noise shifts traffic, wind and mood over minutes, on top of the individual events.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="request" aria-labelledby="request-h">
      <div>
        <h2 id="request-h">Got a scene in mind?</h2>
        <p>Describe a place at night that could run forever, and it might become the next scene.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="cta" href="https://github.com/anistark/nightcity/issues/new?title=Scene%20request%3A%20&amp;body=Where%20is%20the%20scene%2C%20what%20moves%20in%20it%2C%20and%20what%20happens%20now%20and%20then%3F%0A%0A" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Request a scene<svg viewBox="0 0 7 7" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true" shape-rendering="crispEdges"><path fill="currentColor" d="M3 0h1v1H3zM4 1h1v1H4zM5 2h1v1H5zM0 3h7v1H0zM5 4h1v1H5zM4 5h1v1H4zM3 6h1v1H3z"/></svg></a>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>
{% endblock %}

{% block scripts %}
<script>
// Each live preview runs its full scene, so skip them for viewers who prefer reduced motion.
if(!matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches)for(const f of document.querySelectorAll('iframe[data-src]'))f.src=f.dataset.src;

</script>
<script src="{{ root }}assets/js/site.js" defer></script>
<script src="{{ root }}assets/js/pwa.js" defer></script>
{% endblock %}
